    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d662">

                <pb facs="0735" n="723" xml:id="pg723"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">851.01/7–444: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting American Representative to the French
                        Committee of National Liberation at Algiers</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chapin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Algiers</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-07-04T10:00:00+02:00">July 4, 1944—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:16 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2266. Reference my 2254 July 3, 12 noon. Following two names have been added to
                    the party, Lieutenant Colonel Hartemann of the Air General Staff, and André
                    Laguerre, Chief of de Gaulle’s Press Bureau. Major Fitts of ATC,<anchor n="46"
                        xml:id="d662-f1"/> although not a [member of] party, is accompanying it to
                    insure smoothness of trip.</p>
                <p>Members of party including myself but not including Fitts total 12.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
